From b587716e8cc6c5701cec835c1929391a3fa4690c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marcelo Schmitt <marcelo.schmitt@analog.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 18:31:16 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 10273/15333] iio: adc: ltc2378: Enable high-speed data capture

Make use of SPI transfer offloading to speed up data capture, enabling data
acquisition at faster sample rates (up to 2 MSPS).

Reviewed-by: Andy Shevchenko <andriy.shevchenko@intel.com>
Reviewed-by: David Lechner <dlechner@baylibre.com>
Signed-off-by: Marcelo Schmitt <marcelo.schmitt@analog.com>
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Cameron <jonathan.cameron@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 drivers/iio/adc/Kconfig   |   6 +
 drivers/iio/adc/ltc2378.c | 404 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 407 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

